          "body_html": "<p>Optical Circuit Switching (OCS) is a <strong>photonic networking technology</strong>.</p><p>OCS is transforming modern data center architectures by delivering <strong>ultra-low latency</strong>, <strong>scalable bandwidth</strong>, and significant <strong>energy savings</strong>.</p><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "subheading",
          "style": {
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "heading_html": "<p>By the end of this module, you will be able to:</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "list",
          "variant": "bulleted",
          "style": {
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items_html": [
            "<p>Explain what OCS is and how it fundamentally differs from Electrical Packet Switching.</p>",
            "<p>Identify the six primary OCS switching technologies and their operating principles.</p>",
            "<p>Describe production proven OCS deployments at hyperscale operators like Google.</p>",
            "<p>Evaluate emerging OCS application areas like Mixture-of-Experts training and quantum networking.</p>",
            "<p>Locate open standards resources within the OCP community.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "quote",
          "variant": "d",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "LIGHT",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "quote_html": "<p>We want to extend our recognition to <strong>Iwan Kartawira</strong>, <strong>NSI Manager</strong>&nbsp;at <strong>IPronics</strong>. His technical guidance and collaboration were key during the initial course scope definition, and early planning of these courses.</p>",
