        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "paragraph",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "COLOR",
            "background_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "body_html": "<p>Congratulations! You have completed this module.</p><p>Here are some key OCS takeaways:&nbsp;</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "list",
          "variant": "bulleted",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "COLOR",
            "background_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items_html": [
            "<p>OCS establishes direct photonic connections without OEO conversion, operating purely in the optical domain.</p>",
            "<p>This architecture provides significant power savings, ultra-low latency, and future-proof speed compatibility.</p>",
            "<p>OCS does not inspect or route individual packets. Its optical path &nbsp;incurs insertion loss, which must be managed in the system design</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "subheading",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "COLOR",
            "background_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "heading_html": "<p>Now that you understand the foundational physics and trade-offs of optical switching, let's examine the actual <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">physical mechanisms inside the switches</span>, comparing technologies like <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">MEMS mirrors</span> and <span style=\"color: #8cc53f; text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">Silicon Photonics</span>.</p>"
        },
